    "one_line": "When Bollinger Bands were inside Keltner Channels on the prior bar and expand outside now, enter in the direction of close vs EMA with RSI agreement; exit on EMA recross or ATR stop, flat by 15:55. Source: John Carter TTM Squeeze (Mastering the Trade); Alorse Pine repo variant.",
    "family": "volatility_squeeze_breakout",
    "status": "ready_for_review"
  },
